{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a5d42c638756cf1026d3a0f700ed5a678e1f5e2fe2033768527cd5a1da0dc7cf", "ja": "（今日は翼のPV撮影。残すはラストシーン\nのみだが……どうも、うまくいってないみたいだ）", "zh": "（今天是翼的PV拍摄。只剩下最后一个场景了，\n不过……看起来似乎不太顺利）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b1bbcdfc8476a8071d39083f138a132489342e3deb5e2f6fa7fb35cb310711dc", "ja": "翼、お疲れ様。\n時間がかかってるみたいだけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "翼，辛苦了。好像花了不少时间，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ab747ae7dc7d10f9fa0aa7d5defa665db303a16f8f1afaad6f47126c207b782d", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\nえへへっ……なんだかうまくいかなくて。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！  \n嘿嘿……总觉得进展得不太顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "42d15bbbb59dcd74e1d5cc1f6c96ab735c9071e41a675ccf9f6fe57ae412af6b", "ja": "さっきのシーン、イイ感じだと思ったのになぁ。\n監督さんに「もう1回」って言われちゃった。はあ～。", "zh": "刚才那一幕，我还以为感觉挺不错的呢。结果导演却说“已经是第1次了”，唉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9901a6e06acbc76339a11ada2592f195935287823656f77274d4eed5b717395d", "ja": "そうか……翼もさすがに疲れてきたよな？\n別日にしてもらおうか。スタッフに相談して……。", "zh": "这样啊……翼也确实累了吧？\n要不改天再拍？我去和工作人员商量一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "629d93ad97cd0ddde29f487819e57be30b77abf27f5147178afca6b02110a6d7", "ja": "あっ……それは、ダメっ！", "zh": "啊……那可不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6a593a5eba0f9ddf95278dec4f4a90702adf4991b1e1939040becfde4440733c", "ja": "えっ……翼？", "zh": "诶……翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4145b131e7b3e496031b9a5b1b5ee8f4a0532f9ed8e8dc075bfde5435774c107", "ja": "えっと……今止めたら、完成のイメージが、\n見えなくなっちゃう気がするんです。", "zh": "那个……要是现在停下来的话，我觉得就看不到完成时的样子了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ab03a28e44f74a12def15ff40f7895c81cb10895d8f852ef4684c2cc17d113ea", "ja": "{$P$}さんが心配してくれるのは\nうれしいけど、もうちょっとだけ試してみたいの。", "zh": "{$P$}先生关心我，我虽然很高兴，\n但我还想再多尝试一下下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "99bea089b8e48a20761bf044cad7d1d73b7bdd535493d82a5d3d3daed4d0a092", "ja": "もう1回だけ。次でダメだったら、今日は諦めるから。\n{$P$}さん、お願いっ！", "zh": "就再来1次。要是下次还不行，我今天就放弃。\n{$P$}先生，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0a9b37d0d32f4b85dc338a45d63c0ebfcbfec520a6bdd61665398b54f976a123", "ja": "翼がそう言うなら……。\nけど、いつになく気合いが入ってるな？", "zh": "既然翼都这么说了……\n不过，你今天可是格外有干劲啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3a42cf6977e0b70e1b47d260708c07e992b273dab8696cb2b42cd42e303fc3f2", "ja": "そうですか？　たしかに、今までのわたしなら、\nつまんないって思ったかも。同じとこばっかりだし。", "zh": "这样吗？确实，如果是以前的我，可能会觉得很无聊吧。毕竟总是在重复同样的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "58441d356c52b5135d48038389c08ec76074b19de65a6e5e011ef3cbd58c42e6", "ja": "でもでも、今日は違うんです！\nだんだん楽しくなってきちゃって……。", "zh": "可是可是，今天不一样！\n不知不觉变得越来越开心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f98e028c78d0e6559e525ddfac44cc5dd888d2f56fe9cd7e90e5c0664e5046b2", "ja": "楽しい？", "zh": "开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d6b63c20d2a7a5614dcd258e99b1aa1c8358db35e74faa6a7f297d694c00c637", "ja": "うん。どうしたらOKになるかな？って\nいろいろ考えるのが、なんか面白いなーって。", "zh": "嗯。我在想要怎么做才算OK，之类的，觉得思考这些还挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2afb33abdd62d2b62ebfffd3dab048ed301342113b4bbd2174cf90ea29309d11", "ja": "それに、ちょっとずつ良くなってるのもわかるから。\nさっきも監督さんに褒められたんですよ～♪", "zh": "而且，我也能感觉到自己在一点一点变好。\n刚才还被导演夸奖了呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1016_p", "source_sha256": "19758d7fa7bbdbcaadcd5c09da24f7c020a72406c7b712de79775c418e8add42", "ja": "おっ、そうなのか。監督さんがそう言うなら、\n本当にもう少しかもしれないな。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。既然导演都这么说了，说不定真的就差一点了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7cae08541ea5b0fc1c357c6f3411a3459b5a77c26ccd2edb70d36e4cb3d217e8", "ja": "でしょ～？　えへへ♪　だからわたし、\nもうちょっとだけ、頑張ってみたいなって。", "zh": "对吧～？嘿嘿♪所以我想，再稍微努力一下试试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "399eb5c73028dad2704084e5b01680b41f165bebd373ea88696c34d58f6b6a01", "ja": "一瞬で本気を出したりとかは、まだできないけど……。\nわたしなりに全力でぶつかってみたいの！", "zh": "虽然我还做不到一瞬间就拿出全部干劲……但我想按照自己的方式，全力以赴试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a2b767ef9a5c7958f055f2f4bd7d0c213590124cd545f5c86edecc8c546a33c9", "ja": "うん、分かった。\n翼が納得するまで、もうひと頑張りしよう！", "zh": "嗯，我明白了。\n在翼满意之前，再加把劲吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "19c730e409a760556850d8e8356b16d0d506aeb103feb72bcc4aa100c409fafa", "ja": "はーいっ！　{$P$}さんと話してたら\nなんか気持ちが楽になったかも。", "zh": "好——！和{$P$}先生聊了聊，感觉心情好像轻松多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "65def3271efb34f16d8e06d8140686eb77f06af248418b50b345d9963be93044", "ja": "よーし！　次こそOKもらうんだからっ！\n見ててくださいね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "好——！这次我一定要得到同意！\n请看好了，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0314_1022_p", "source_sha256": "cc54669e3974521e0320e43e8b1e6fbd0ee84fe4df21c443596318d4f79926ac", "ja": "（ここまで本気になった翼が、どれほどのものを\n出してくれるか……見せてもらうとしよう！）", "zh": "（既然翼已经认真到这种程度了，就让我看看她究竟能拿出什么样的表现吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
